---
import '../styles/global.css';
import OceanExperience from '../components/OceanExperience.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import { channels, projects, research, verifiedLink } from '../data/content';

const github = verifiedLink(channels.github);
const description = '미지의 가능성을 탐구하고, 실용적이고 검증 가능한 AI 시스템을 만드는 독립 연구·개발 공동체.';
const title = 'Arete Club — Independent AI Research & Development';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#061521" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Arete Club" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <!-- Choose the scroll layout before first paint so anchors do not shift. -->
    <script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add('js');</script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#about">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>
    <main>
      <OceanExperience showContact={Boolean(github || channels.email)} />

      <div class="deep-content">
        <section id="about" class="section wrap about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
          <div class="section-label mono"><span>01 / ABOUT ARETE CLUB</span><span class="tiny-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span></div>
          <div class="section-grid">
            <div><p class="small-label">깊이 탐구하고, 충실하게 만듭니다.</p><h2 id="about-title">A Pursuit of<br />Excellence<span class="accent">.</span></h2></div>
            <div class="about-copy">
              <p>Arete는 고대 그리스어의 탁월함에서 출발합니다. 우리는 기술이 본래의 목적을 명확하고 충실하게 수행할 때 탁월해진다고 믿습니다.</p>
              <p>바다는 우리 가까이에 있으면서도 여전히 미지의 영역을 품고 있습니다. 그 탐험의 정신이 Arete Club의 출발점입니다.</p>
              <div class="values mono"><span>EXPLORATION</span><span>EXCELLENCE</span><span>ENGINEERING</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="research" class="section wrap research" aria-labelledby="research-title">
          <div class="section-label mono"><span>02 / RESEARCH</span><span class="tiny-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span></div>
          <div class="research-heading"><h2 id="research-title">What We Explore<span class="accent">.</span></h2><p>지능형 시스템이 더 신뢰할 수 있고 효율적이며,<br class="desktop-break" /> 인간의 의도에 부합하도록 만드는 방법을 탐구합니다.</p></div>
          <p class="small-label research-caption">우리의 연구 관심 분야</p>
          <div class="research-list">
            {research.map((area, index) => <article class="research-row">
              <span class="research-index mono" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
              <h3>{area.title}</h3><p>{area.description}</p><span class="research-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </article>)}
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects" class="section wrap projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
          <div class="section-label mono"><span>03 / PROJECTS</span><span class="tiny-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span></div>
          <div class="projects-heading"><h2 id="projects-title">Ideas, into practice<span class="accent">.</span></h2><p>탐구를 실제 프로젝트로 이어갑니다.</p></div>
          <div class="project-grid">{projects.map((project, index) => <ProjectCard project={project} index={index} />)}</div>
        </section>

        {github && <section id="exploration" class="section wrap exploration" aria-labelledby="exploration-title">
          <div class="section-label mono"><span>04 / OPEN EXPLORATION</span><span class="tiny-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span></div>
          <div class="exploration-body">
            <h2 id="exploration-title">Open Exploration<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
            <div>
              <p>공개된 프로젝트와 연구 활동은 GitHub에서 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>
              <a class="work-link" href={github}>Arete Club on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>}

        <footer id="contact" class="footer wrap" aria-label="Contact">
          <div class="footer-top"><a href="#top" class="wordmark">Arete Club<span class="wordmark-dot" aria-hidden="true">.</span></a><p>Curiosity drives exploration.<br />Evidence guides progress.</p></div>
          <div class="footer-bottom"><span class="mono">© Arete Club</span>
            {(github || channels.email) && <div class="official-links">{github && <a href={github}>GitHub ↗</a>}{channels.email && <a href={`mailto:${channels.email}`}>Contact ↗</a>}</div>}
            <a class="back-top mono" href="#top">BACK TO SURFACE <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a>
          </div>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </main>
    <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <script>
      import { mountOcean } from '../scripts/ocean/mount';
      const ocean = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.ocean');
      if (ocean) mountOcean(ocean);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
